# BazaarBoard env vars — all server-side. Never NEXT_PUBLIC_-prefix any
# of these. Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the same on the Vercel
# project for prod.

# Day-of hackathon credential. Provisioned by Google DeepMind at 10:30 AM
# per the participant guide. The /api/generate route reads this and
# forwards to gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image (NB2 Lite).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Override the model. Defaults to the pre-day-of stand-in
# "gemini-2.5-flash-image-preview" so we can develop before creds arrive.
# On hackathon morning, set this to "gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image".
# NB2_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image
